1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>好啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:08,299 --> 00:00:12,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>裹胸布好像有点太宽松了</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:12,262 --> 00:00:14,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 怎么磨磨蹭蹭的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:19,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:22,063 --> 00:00:25,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:01:56,449 --> 00:01:58,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是一如既往地毫不留情啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:01:58,785 --> 00:02:01,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>“一如既往”是什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:02:01,287 --> 00:02:03,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天要外出训练吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:02:03,498 --> 00:02:06,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 去一直承蒙关照的前川道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:02:06,876 --> 00:02:09,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 今天剑心要不要也一起去？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:02:09,087 --> 00:02:13,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>前川师父说很想见你一面</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:02:13,883 --> 00:02:17,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就不去了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:17,137 --> 00:02:19,097
<c.simplifiedchinese>还要砍柴烧水呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:19,180 --> 00:02:22,433
<c.simplifiedchinese>那采购也拜托你顺便做了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:22,517 --> 00:02:26,396
<c.simplifiedchinese>买些味增、盐、米、酱油 别忘了醋</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:29,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然还是一起去吧…</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:29,107 --> 00:02:30,316
<c.simplifiedchinese>明智的选择</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:33,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 那我们走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:35,113 --> 00:02:36,489
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:36,573 --> 00:02:39,826
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然花了些时间 但大概都查清楚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:44,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>附近最兴盛的是中越流前川道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:45,123 --> 00:02:49,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父前川宫内
可能是这一带最厉害的剑术高手</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:51,087 --> 00:02:57,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有传言说神谷活心流的道场
住着一位技艺高超的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:57,302 --> 00:02:58,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过充其量只是个浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:02:59,012 --> 00:03:00,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么了不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:01,055 --> 00:03:02,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 跟我来</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:02,932 --> 00:03:04,142
<c.simplifiedchinese>是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:05,977 --> 00:03:08,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>（中越流 前川道场）</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:09,314 --> 00:03:10,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>面！</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:10,273 --> 00:03:13,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>（质实刚剑）</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家好</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:16,321 --> 00:03:17,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:20,033
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你好 薰小姐
-你好</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:20,617 --> 00:03:21,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一直在等你</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:21,951 --> 00:03:25,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>别在意我 请继续训练吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:25,163 --> 00:03:26,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰说得对</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:26,956 --> 00:03:29,334
<c.simplifiedchinese>继续训练 别分心</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:29,417 --> 00:03:31,127
<c.simplifiedchinese>前川师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:31,628 --> 00:03:37,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此
你就是薰一直提到的剑心吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:37,091 --> 00:03:39,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>他就是那个传说很厉害的浪客？</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:40,345 --> 00:03:41,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:42,055 --> 00:03:46,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>前川师父非常想和他切磋一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:49,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉这场战斗会很激烈</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:51,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>输家肯定没法全身而退吧…</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:52,523 --> 00:03:56,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>前川师父从来没有跟我提过这件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:07,205 --> 00:04:08,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>很高兴你能来</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:08,873 --> 00:04:10,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>请一定指点指点我的门生</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:10,625 --> 00:04:13,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 在下只是来陪着薰小姐的</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:15,088 --> 00:04:17,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 那么请那边坐</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:17,966 --> 00:04:19,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:23,179 --> 00:04:24,681
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:25,265 --> 00:04:26,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>很抱歉瞒着你</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:27,016 --> 00:04:29,686
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我说了 你永远不会带他来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:29,769 --> 00:04:33,147
<c.simplifiedchinese>放心吧 我已经不想再打了</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:33,731 --> 00:04:37,777
<c.simplifiedchinese>或者说 还没打老夫就已经输了</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:38,778 --> 00:04:39,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:40,613 --> 00:04:43,032
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个年轻人的眼神多么清澈啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:45,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>（质实刚剑）</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:46,411 --> 00:04:48,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>对手进攻时不要惊慌！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:50,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>腰部不要后退</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:50,748 --> 00:04:52,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先盯着对手的眼睛</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:04:52,583 --> 00:04:54,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>-明白了？
-非常感谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:04:55,044 --> 00:04:56,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 下一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:04:57,255 --> 00:05:00,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>你觉得我的道场怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:01,676 --> 00:05:03,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:03,344 --> 00:05:05,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>门生又多又有活力</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:05,930 --> 00:05:09,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里 平常只有三分之一的人会出现</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:10,059 --> 00:05:13,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天人这么多
是因为有名的剑术美人要来训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:13,604 --> 00:05:17,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于年轻人来说 她很有魅力</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:17,233 --> 00:05:21,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>认真练习剑术的也就十来个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:22,071 --> 00:05:23,448
<c.simplifiedchinese>很惭愧</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:23,531 --> 00:05:29,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是江户时代镇上
曾经最有名的大道场如今的光景</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:29,662 --> 00:05:33,082
<c.simplifiedchinese>最可悲的是</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:33,166 --> 00:05:40,048
<c.simplifiedchinese>不得不靠剑友神谷越路郎的遗孤
来吸引人气的老夫啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:40,131 --> 00:05:43,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要这样非议自己</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:43,885 --> 00:05:48,765
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷道场也受了您很多关照
比如说让我们过来训练</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:48,848 --> 00:05:51,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是互利的事情啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:53,978 --> 00:05:58,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 未来剑术会如何发展呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:02,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治维新和文明开化</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:02,862 --> 00:06:06,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>让剑术逐渐式微</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:06,991 --> 00:06:11,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>当年每天都有剑客前来踢馆
真像一场梦</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:14,916 --> 00:06:18,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 神圣的道场禁止穿鞋进入！</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:18,753 --> 00:06:19,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>脱掉你的草鞋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:20,463 --> 00:06:21,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>拦住他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:24,300 --> 00:06:26,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:38,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>中越流开创者 前川宫内</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:41,776
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我打一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:44,237 --> 00:06:46,447
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾乃石动雷十太</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:46,948 --> 00:06:50,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个对剑术的未来深感忧虑的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:56,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的眼睛太浑浊 让人看不透</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:56,833 --> 00:06:59,001
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是他很强</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:59,627 --> 00:07:01,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我打一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:01,295 --> 00:07:02,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>离开这里！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:02,588 --> 00:07:04,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>道场现在不接受其他道场的挑战…</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:05,216
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:05,883 --> 00:07:07,927
<c.simplifiedchinese>如你所言 雷十太</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:08,010 --> 00:07:10,179
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们来比一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:10,763 --> 00:07:13,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>按照惯例三分定胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:13,099 --> 00:07:15,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>先得两分者胜</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:16,644 --> 00:07:17,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:17,812 --> 00:07:19,021
<c.simplifiedchinese>前川师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:19,105 --> 00:07:20,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:20,481 --> 00:07:22,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人不是普通人</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:25,528
<c.simplifiedchinese>正因如此 我才接受他的挑战</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:26,028 --> 00:07:27,613
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然上了年纪</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:27,697 --> 00:07:33,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我江户十二杰 前川宫内
可不能轻易输掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>竹刀吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:37,039 --> 00:07:38,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>不值一提</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:38,666 --> 00:07:40,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:40,543 --> 00:07:42,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>-师父！
-由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:42,753 --> 00:07:44,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>你来晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:44,338 --> 00:07:45,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也没办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:49,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父的步子比我大太多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:52,263
<c.simplifiedchinese>我已经全力快跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:55,516
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 师父要用真剑还是木刀？</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>竹刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:57,810 --> 00:08:00,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>竹刀？不是吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:00,855 --> 00:08:02,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>用这种玩具来分胜负吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:03,024 --> 00:08:05,776
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来这道场有名无实啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:07,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:09,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为你是谁啊 小屁孩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:10,031 --> 00:08:11,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才小屁孩呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:11,991 --> 00:08:12,950
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:13,034 --> 00:08:16,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是神谷活心流首席门生明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:17,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我记好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:17,997 --> 00:08:21,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是雷十太师父的首席弟子
塚山由太郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:21,292 --> 00:08:23,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才那一脚你会付出代价的</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:25,880
<c.simplifiedchinese>住口</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:28,633 --> 00:08:32,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧 吾辈没带竹刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:34,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>就借一把</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:35,097 --> 00:08:38,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的前川师父很难获胜</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:38,893 --> 00:08:43,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算各得一分打成平手
最后的一分也会被对方拿到</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:45,066 --> 00:08:52,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么公平起见
裁判就由其他流派的我神谷薰来担任</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:52,114 --> 00:08:53,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:53,491 --> 00:08:56,369
<c.simplifiedchinese>值不值得一提 我会让你领教</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:57,495 --> 00:08:58,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一回合！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:00,998 --> 00:09:01,999
<c.simplifiedchinese>好强的气</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:04,126 --> 00:09:07,129
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使不领教 我也已经知道了</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:08,172 --> 00:09:13,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>当你要用竹刀三分定胜负时
就暴露了你的弱小！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:13,427 --> 00:09:14,428
<c.simplifiedchinese>小心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:21,686 --> 00:09:24,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>他跳起来那一刻 我根本没看清</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:24,313 --> 00:09:26,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么庞大的身躯 真是好快的速度…</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:26,983 --> 00:09:28,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才那一分不算吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:29,735 --> 00:09:32,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>-师父！
-击中面部 得一分！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:32,238 --> 00:09:33,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害…</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:33,990 --> 00:09:38,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然没击中
但那向下一击却蕴含着惊人的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:39,453 --> 00:09:41,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>那不是没击中</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:41,205 --> 00:09:42,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>头顶的一击</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:47,962
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为面部的护具是圆形的
剑偶尔会打滑</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:48,045 --> 00:09:52,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此向下的攻击要瞄准肩膀</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:52,091 --> 00:09:53,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是古流剑术的常规做法</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:55,928 --> 00:09:58,806
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好 肩膀的骨头都裂开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:58,889 --> 00:10:00,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>-得赶紧看医生…
-等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:00,891 --> 00:10:03,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>比试还没结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:05,354 --> 00:10:07,231
<c.simplifiedchinese>第二回合</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:12,403 --> 00:10:13,696
<c.simplifiedchinese>第二回合！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:15,531 --> 00:10:16,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>可笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:16,532 --> 00:10:19,910
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一击你就已经死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:22,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>第二分！</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,748
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负已分 比赛结束！</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:24,498 --> 00:10:27,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>连自己败北都看不出来的蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:29,378 --> 00:10:30,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:30,296 --> 00:10:31,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要干什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:39,597 --> 00:10:42,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经拿到两分 赢得了比试</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:43,392 --> 00:10:44,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>还想杀了他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:45,603 --> 00:10:46,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>正是</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:48,064 --> 00:10:51,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>每个人只有一条命</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:51,651 --> 00:10:55,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>这意味着都是一局定胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:55,363 --> 00:10:57,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是你死 就是我活</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:03,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>江户时代后
竹刀的发明的确让剑术流行起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:03,454 --> 00:11:08,084
<c.simplifiedchinese>但却失去了古流剑术那种强大威力</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:08,167 --> 00:11:10,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术不断衰弱</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:10,503 --> 00:11:15,216
<c.simplifiedchinese>在这个可悲的时代
还为竹刀剑术沾沾自喜的蠢货们</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:15,299 --> 00:11:18,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有持剑的资格！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:24,308 --> 00:11:27,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是这个道场的人吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:28,104 --> 00:11:31,232
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是 在下暂时住在神谷道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:31,315 --> 00:11:35,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 你就是那个技艺高超的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:35,903 --> 00:11:37,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:37,279 --> 00:11:38,948
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我比一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:39,031 --> 00:11:40,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>用真剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:43,702 --> 00:11:47,248
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不准备为比试或炫耀武艺而拔剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:47,915 --> 00:11:49,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:49,417 --> 00:11:51,293
<c.simplifiedchinese>-由太郎
-在</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:51,377 --> 00:11:54,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>摘下道场的牌子烧掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:55,005 --> 00:11:57,425
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈已经打败了道场的师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:58,008 --> 00:12:00,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>道场的招牌就随我处置</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:01,011 --> 00:12:03,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>有谁不服 就来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:04,098 --> 00:12:06,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会马上了结你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:06,976 --> 00:12:11,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>不如我们在大街上把招牌烧掉吧
这样每个人都可以…</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:11,313 --> 00:12:13,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>你够了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:13,524 --> 00:12:14,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>放手</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:14,942 --> 00:12:15,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>你找死吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:19,321 --> 00:12:20,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:20,823 --> 00:12:23,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>招牌被烧也没关系吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:25,035 --> 00:12:27,538
<c.simplifiedchinese>全都是不值一提的鼠辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:27,621 --> 00:12:28,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:29,248 --> 00:12:30,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来当你的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:30,374 --> 00:12:31,375
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:32,126 --> 00:12:35,337
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈不会因为你是女人就心慈手软</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:36,505 --> 00:12:37,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:37,631 --> 00:12:39,925
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下来做你的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:43,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这毕竟是对道场的正式挑战</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:43,512 --> 00:12:45,097
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能用真剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:45,181 --> 00:12:47,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:12:47,349 --> 00:12:48,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就用木刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:12:48,726 --> 00:12:50,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>一场定胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:12:54,607 --> 00:12:56,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>你可以吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:12:56,150 --> 00:12:57,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:12:58,277 --> 00:12:59,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>小心点</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:12:59,528 --> 00:13:01,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不是一般的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:01,989 --> 00:13:03,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:03,949 --> 00:13:05,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>开始吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:07,119 --> 00:13:08,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁来做裁判？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:08,913 --> 00:13:10,080
<c.simplifiedchinese>不需要</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:14,627 --> 00:13:17,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>终于能见识那个浪客的实力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:17,087 --> 00:13:20,216
<c.simplifiedchinese>是 但他真的有传言的那么厉害吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:28,349 --> 00:13:32,102
<c.simplifiedchinese>雷十太那家伙的攻击如此迅速威猛！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:32,186 --> 00:13:34,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>而浪客轻轻松松地躲开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:34,438 --> 00:13:36,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然像前川师父想得那样有实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:37,066 --> 00:13:39,610
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们俩的攻防的确都很厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:39,693 --> 00:13:40,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:40,653 --> 00:13:42,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不反击？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:43,030 --> 00:13:44,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:46,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:46,367 --> 00:13:51,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>你打算拖延时间打成平局
让吾辈拿不到道场招牌</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:13:52,831 --> 00:13:55,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就试试这个吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:13:56,168 --> 00:13:57,044
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:13:59,547 --> 00:14:00,714
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:07,930 --> 00:14:10,099
<c.simplifiedchinese>你叫什么名字？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:10,182 --> 00:14:11,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:12,393 --> 00:14:13,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会记住的</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:15,312 --> 00:14:16,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:17,147 --> 00:14:17,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:18,607 --> 00:14:20,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不太明白刚刚发生了什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:20,276 --> 00:14:21,902
<c.simplifiedchinese>但师父显然更胜一筹</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:21,986 --> 00:14:23,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>少说大话</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:23,904 --> 00:14:26,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心都没拿出一半的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:28,033 --> 00:14:31,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>我迟早要和你做个了断</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:33,956 --> 00:14:37,167
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那之前做好觉悟吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:39,128 --> 00:14:41,797
<c.simplifiedchinese>天啊 张狂的臭小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:43,382 --> 00:14:48,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么“没拿出一半实力”？
嘴硬不想认输而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:48,846 --> 00:14:52,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>-绯村剑心…
-师父？</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:14:53,851 --> 00:14:58,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的秘剑饭纲
还是第一次有人躲得开</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:14:58,522 --> 00:15:01,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人恐怕是古流剑术的修习者</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:01,108 --> 00:15:03,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且水平相当高</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:03,611 --> 00:15:07,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心 实力真是无可挑剔</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:08,824 --> 00:15:09,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害…</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:09,742 --> 00:15:10,910
<c.simplifiedchinese>这到底是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:10,993 --> 00:15:13,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来就像是用真剑劈的</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:16,624 --> 00:15:18,167
<c.simplifiedchinese>何止真剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:19,501 --> 00:15:23,380
<c.simplifiedchinese>这比真剑还要锋利得多</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:23,964 --> 00:15:27,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>这可不是普通踢馆人的雕虫小技</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:27,676 --> 00:15:31,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个石动雷十太到底是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:34,099 --> 00:15:35,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:35,976 --> 00:15:39,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很久没遇到这么有意思的家伙了</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:39,813 --> 00:15:41,190
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么有意思！
-哎呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:41,273 --> 00:15:46,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为他 前川道场要暂时关门了</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:50,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他们俩公平地比试了 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:50,699 --> 00:15:53,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>-而最终前川被完胜了
-可是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:53,661 --> 00:15:59,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>身为一个流派的传人、道场的师父
也不能拿对手太强做借口</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:15:59,583 --> 00:16:01,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>对吧 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:02,086 --> 00:16:04,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:04,838 --> 00:16:06,256
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而…</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:10,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个根本看不起竹刀剑术
只注重实战的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:10,469 --> 00:16:13,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>上门踢馆究竟为了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:14,348 --> 00:16:15,975
<c.simplifiedchinese>打扰一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:16,558 --> 00:16:20,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心先生住在这里吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:20,104 --> 00:16:22,523
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下就是绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:24,817 --> 00:16:26,568
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是给您的</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:26,652 --> 00:16:27,361
<c.simplifiedchinese>（请帖）</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:30,155 --> 00:16:30,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>（石动雷十太）</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:30,823 --> 00:16:31,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:31,782 --> 00:16:32,992
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:33,075 --> 00:16:35,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>肯定是决斗书吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:35,619 --> 00:16:38,706
<c.simplifiedchinese>不清楚 我只是个管家</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:38,789 --> 00:16:41,917
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之 马车已经在门外等您</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:43,127
<c.simplifiedchinese>请</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:16:45,921 --> 00:16:47,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>这边请</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:16:47,715 --> 00:16:51,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>穿过这个庭院就是主宅</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:16:53,178 --> 00:16:54,555
<c.simplifiedchinese>是绯村先生吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:16:55,139 --> 00:16:56,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>初次见面</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:16:56,306 --> 00:16:58,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是这里的主人</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:00,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫塚山由左卫门</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:00,811 --> 00:17:02,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>塚山？</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:02,604 --> 00:17:04,690
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道是那个臭小子的父亲？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:04,773 --> 00:17:06,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>你才臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:06,692 --> 00:17:09,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>雷十太师父只叫了绯村一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:09,737 --> 00:17:10,738
<c.simplifiedchinese>你来干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:10,821 --> 00:17:11,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎 住口</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:12,614 --> 00:17:16,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是师父的客人 不准无礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:17,494 --> 00:17:19,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>实在抱歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:19,413 --> 00:17:21,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>犬子实在无礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:21,915 --> 00:17:22,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:22,875 --> 00:17:25,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父在池塘边等您</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:17:25,836 --> 00:17:27,504
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来为您带路</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:17:27,588 --> 00:17:29,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>这边请</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:36,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎 你好好招待其他客人</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:17:38,766 --> 00:17:40,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>没办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:17:40,142 --> 00:17:42,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>就给你们点冷茶残羹吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:17:42,936 --> 00:17:45,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 真是热情的招待啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:17:45,981 --> 00:17:50,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过抱歉 就别在意我们了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:17:50,527 --> 00:17:51,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:17:53,030 --> 00:17:56,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是个做刀剑出口生意的商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:17:56,450 --> 00:18:01,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>日本的刀剑在欧洲
被奉为艺术品 价格不菲</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:01,497 --> 00:18:06,668
<c.simplifiedchinese>三个月前 我的马车被匪徒劫持了</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:06,752 --> 00:18:09,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父刚巧路过 救了我</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:15,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>由太郎被师父的高超武艺折服
想要拜他为师</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:15,928 --> 00:18:21,308
<c.simplifiedchinese>后来 师父就作为由太郎的剑术师父
暂住在我家</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:22,476 --> 00:18:23,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:25,062 --> 00:18:26,730
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么二位慢慢聊</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:31,944 --> 00:18:34,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就是雷十太啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:34,655 --> 00:18:37,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说你们那样对那孩子 没关系吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:40,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么关系？他活该！</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:18:43,789 --> 00:18:45,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>你邀请在下有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:18:46,542 --> 00:18:49,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>你如何看待日本剑术的现状？</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:18:49,795 --> 00:18:52,172
<c.simplifiedchinese>不觉得它失去了灵魂？</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:18:52,256 --> 00:18:55,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>逐渐变得脆弱、软弱吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:59,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>弱者总会被淘汰</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:18:59,596 --> 00:19:01,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是自然之道</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:04,309 --> 00:19:06,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈的流派是真古流</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:06,979 --> 00:19:11,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望能够完成剑术再复兴的大业</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:11,525 --> 00:19:15,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有这样的雄心壮志
为什么还要到处踢馆呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:16,029 --> 00:19:21,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>吾辈的目标是
彻底消灭现有的五百多个剑术流派</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:22,953 --> 00:19:24,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是要复兴剑术吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:26,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:26,248 --> 00:19:30,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在此之前 必须先剔除无能的东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:37,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先就是把剑术弱化的罪魁祸首
竹刀剑术统统消灭</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:38,802 --> 00:19:40,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那之后</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:40,387 --> 00:19:41,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的新古流</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:19:42,055 --> 00:19:45,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>将成为日本唯一的正统剑术
开始再次复兴</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:19:45,392 --> 00:19:50,314
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的目标是创造不输西洋枪械的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:19:50,397 --> 00:19:51,773
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:19:51,857 --> 00:19:53,358
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:19:53,442 --> 00:19:59,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>只传承最强的剑术
来保持剑术的威力和纯粹</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:19:59,114 --> 00:20:03,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是躲开了我的秘剑饭纲的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:03,702 --> 00:20:05,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>助我一臂之力吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:06,997 --> 00:20:10,542
<c.simplifiedchinese>古流剑术是注重实战的杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:20:11,043 --> 00:20:13,503
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一点你清楚吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:20:13,587 --> 00:20:14,838
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:20:14,922 --> 00:20:19,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在主流的竹刀剑术不过是赝品</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:20,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:20:22,262 --> 00:20:26,558
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你和在下道不同不相为谋</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:20:27,643 --> 00:20:31,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术就这样衰弱下去
你难道没有任何感觉吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:20:33,106 --> 00:20:35,484
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为一个剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:20:35,567 --> 00:20:38,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下衷心希望剑术发扬光大</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:20:39,238 --> 00:20:44,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在下并不愿看到杀人剑横行的未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:20:45,035 --> 00:20:48,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不否认杀戮才是剑术的本质</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:20:48,497 --> 00:20:53,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>但滥杀无辜或毁灭救人剑的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:57,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下一定会全力阻止</c.simplifiedchinese>

351
00:20:59,383 --> 00:21:00,634
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

352
00:21:01,218 --> 00:21:04,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不能赞同吾辈的大志啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

353
00:21:08,141 --> 00:21:09,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么</c.simplifiedchinese>

354
00:21:09,601 --> 00:21:12,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>从现在起 你就是我的敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

355
00:22:47,074 --> 00:22:49,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《理想的男人》</c.simplifiedchinese>

